        "Abstract_or_Key_Finding": "Weathered BOFS free lime largely converted to portlandite, which accelerates Na2CO3-activated slag (induction ~4 d -> ~10 h; setting from ~3 d to 280 min). 20% BOFS gave 39-45 MPa at 28 d; mechanically activated BOF* in Na2CO3 system reached 45 MPa, comparable to pure GGBFS (46 MPa). In silicate systems portlandite reacts incompletely.",
